     <td><para unique="1046545">EVEX.128.NP.MAP5.W0 5D /r</para>
      <para unique="1046546">VMINPH xmm1{k1}{z}, xmm2, xmm3/m128/m16bcst</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046548">A</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046550">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046552">(AVX512_FP16 AND AVX512VL) OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+324415"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046557">Return the minimum packed FP16 values between xmm2 and xmm3/m128/m16bcst and store the result in xmm1 subject to writemask k1.</para>
      </td>
