      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046541">(AVX512_FP16 AND AVX512VL) OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+641455"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046543">Return the minimum packed FP16 values between ymm2 and ymm3/m256/m16bcst and store the result in ymm1 subject to writemask k1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td><para unique="1046522">EVEX.512.NP.MAP5.W0 5D /r</para>
      <para unique="1046523">VMINPH zmm1{k1}{z}, zmm2, zmm3/m512/m16bcst {sae}</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046525">A</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046527">V/V</para>
