     <td><para unique="1046529">AVX512_FP16</para>
      <para unique="1046530">OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+495438"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046532">Return the minimum packed FP16 values between zmm2 and zmm3/m512/m16bcst and store the result in zmm1 subject to writemask k1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
